<h1>Central Mall - Central University (Miotso Campus)</h1>
<p><strong>Official Technical Documentation & Execution Guide</strong></p>
<p>Application built for Central University Ghana (Miotso Main Campus) featuring a Python 3.10 Backend Engine, Live Campus GPS Navigator, Universal Search Bar, Central Marketplace, School Clinic Desk, and AI Assistant.</p>

<h2>1. Key Features</h2>
<h3>🐍 Python 3.10 Backend (server.py)</h3>
<ul>
<li>Native Python HTTP Server running on port 8000.</li>
<li>Serves live GPS telemetry, campus building search, marketplace items, order processing, and AI integrations.</li>
<li>Zero extra pip dependencies required — built with Python standard library (http.server, urllib, json).</li>
</ul>

<h3>📍 Campus Live GPS Navigator (GPSView.tsx)</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Interactive Campus Map:</strong> Visualizes Senate Building, Trinity Hall, Destiny Hall, Central Library, Law Faculty, Clinic, and Sports Complex.</li>
<li><strong>Live Vehicle & Node Tracking:</strong> Real-time position updates for Campus Shuttles, Emergency Ambulance, and Security Patrols.</li>
<li><strong>Turn-by-Turn Route Guidance:</strong> Select start and destination locations to calculate walking distance (meters), estimated walk time (minutes), and directions.</li>
<li><strong>Live Walking Simulation:</strong> Test turn-by-turn navigation in real-time on screen.</li>
</ul>

<h3>🔍 Universal Campus Search Bar</h3>
<ul>
<li>Instant search across all campus facilities, halls, hostel rooms, facilities, and marketplace listings.</li>
<li>Real-time dropdown displaying instant matches with quick navigation to GPS locations or shop items.</li>
</ul>

<h3>🛒 Central Marketplace</h3>
<ul>
<li>Buy & sell textbooks, electronics, campus fashion, food, and hostel appliances.</li>
<li>Ghana Payment Integration: MTN MoMo and Telecel Cash payment checkout flow.</li>
</ul>

<h3>🏥 School Clinic Desk</h3>
<ul>
<li>24/7 Medical advice, health symptom triage, consultation booking, and one-click emergency ambulance dispatch (+233 30 393 0000).</li>
</ul>

<h2>2. Architecture Overview</h2>
<pre>
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│              React 18 + Vite Frontend                   │
│              (Tailwind CSS + Motion)                    │
└────────────────────────────┬────────────────────────────┘
                             │ (Port 3000)
                             ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│               Node Express Server                       │
│                   (server.ts)                           │
└────────────────────────────┬────────────────────────────┘
                             │ Proxy /api/*
                             ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│              Python 3.10 Backend                        │
│                   (server.py)                           │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
</pre>

<h2>3. How to Run the Application</h2>

<h3>Prerequisites</h3>
<ul>
<li>Node.js v18.x or higher</li>
<li>Python 3.10 or higher</li>
<li>npm or bun</li>
</ul>

<h3>Step 1: Install Dependencies</h3>
<pre>npm install</pre>

<h3>Step 2: Set Environment Variables (Optional)</h3>
<pre>GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here</pre>

<h3>Step 3: Start Development Mode</h3>
<pre>npm run dev</pre>
<p>This command starts <code>server.ts</code> on port 3000, which automatically launches <code>server.py</code> on port 8000 and serves the web application at <code>http://localhost:3000</code>.</p>

<h3>Step 4: Production Build & Deployment</h3>
<pre>npm run build
npm start</pre>

<h2>4. API Endpoints Reference</h2>
<table>
<tr><th>Method</th><th>Endpoint</th><th>Description</th></tr>
<tr><td>GET</td><td>/api/health</td><td>Backend status check</td></tr>
<tr><td>GET</td><td>/api/gps/locations</td><td>Fetch live GPS coordinates for campus nodes</td></tr>
<tr><td>POST</td><td>/api/gps/update-location</td><td>Register or update live user location</td></tr>
<tr><td>GET</td><td>/api/gps/search?q={query}</td><td>Universal search across buildings & marketplace</td></tr>
<tr><td>GET</td><td>/api/products</td><td>Retrieve all marketplace listings</td></tr>
<tr><td>POST</td><td>/api/products</td><td>Publish a new item to sell</td></tr>
<tr><td>POST</td><td>/api/orders</td><td>Submit a new order (MTN MoMo / Telecel)</td></tr>
<tr><td>POST</td><td>/api/clinic/chat</td><td>Triage health symptoms & emergency guidance</td></tr>
<tr><td>POST</td><td>/api/ai/chat</td><td>Central AI Assistant endpoint</td></tr>
</table>

<h2>5. Campus Location Codes</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>SEN-01:</strong> Senate Building & Admin Block</li>
<li><strong>TRN-H1:</strong> Trinity Hall (Male Hostel)</li>
<li><strong>DST-H2:</strong> Destiny Hall (Female Hostel)</li>
<li><strong>LIB-01:</strong> Central Main Library</li>
<li><strong>CLN-01:</strong> School Clinic & Emergency Bay</li>
<li><strong>LAW-01:</strong> Law Faculty & Moot Court</li>
<li><strong>SPT-01:</strong> Miotso Sports Complex</li>
</ul>

<p><em>Documentation generated for Central University Ghana (Miotso Campus).</em></p>
